  "energy_arc": "alaap: Spooky, atmospheric unmetered exposition over the low D drone.\nmukhada: Heavy mid-tempo doom entrance with monolithic power chords and singing sitar.\nmanjha: Somber, cavernous pull down into the mandra register.\nmukhada: Re-establishment of the heavy groove with increased drum intensity.\nbreakdown: Crushing, low-end rhythmic pulverization with lead resting.\nantara: High-register ascent lifting the emotional weight into taar Sa.\ntaan_long: Maximum virtuosic peak driven by relentless double-kick doom rhythm.\nmukhada: Triumphant, weighted return of the central hook at full band power.\noutro: Slow decaying doom chords trailing into the eternal tanpura."
